WEBVTT

01:27.745 --> 01:28.945
LOVE & CROWN

01:29.025 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN"
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:31.105 --> 01:34.025
EPISODE 17

02:02.465 --> 02:04.665
General, we have been
stationed here for far too long,

02:04.745 --> 02:05.585
only guarding and never striking back.

02:06.465 --> 02:07.785
I fear the men may soon lose their spirit.

02:25.865 --> 02:27.465
It should be soon.

02:28.105 --> 02:29.465
Report!

02:31.185 --> 02:33.585
General, I sent our men to
search the entire hunting ground,

02:33.665 --> 02:34.985
and we found nothing unusual.

02:35.985 --> 02:38.505
General, you still
suspect that Bai Chifan?

02:38.585 --> 02:39.585
In my view,

02:39.665 --> 02:41.265
he has eyes only for Miss Lin,

02:41.345 --> 02:42.425
and aside from that,

02:42.505 --> 02:43.625
he seems to have no other purpose.

02:50.705 --> 02:52.385
But I have always felt

02:53.985 --> 02:55.825
that this man is not so simple.

03:00.105 --> 03:00.985
Mr. Bai.

03:02.425 --> 03:03.265
Your Highness.

03:03.865 --> 03:06.105
Mr. Bai, you look quite worn and weary.

03:06.185 --> 03:07.185
Is it…

03:07.265 --> 03:09.625
because a certain lady
keeps you tossing till dawn,

03:09.705 --> 03:10.945
unable to sleep?

03:12.465 --> 03:14.465
Your Highness,
please do not make sport of me.

03:17.425 --> 03:18.785
Did you not say last time

03:18.865 --> 03:20.345
that as long as I won the contest,

03:20.425 --> 03:22.625
you would help
bring Cangcang and me together?

03:23.425 --> 03:24.785
You are too impatient,

03:25.785 --> 03:27.345
and I have yet to think of a way.

03:29.465 --> 03:31.185
Miss Lin has a stubborn temper,

03:32.105 --> 03:33.505
and she is not easily coaxed.

03:33.585 --> 03:35.185
Even acting as
your matchmaker is no easy task.

03:37.305 --> 03:39.585
Your Highness is clever and quick-witted.

03:39.665 --> 03:41.785
If even Your Highness is at a loss,

03:41.865 --> 03:43.905
then I truly do not
know what else I can do.

03:45.465 --> 03:46.505
As for a solution,

03:47.585 --> 03:48.905
it is not that there is none.

03:51.705 --> 03:53.185
There is no lady who does not like

03:53.265 --> 03:55.065
a handsome and dashing young man.

03:56.345 --> 03:57.905
If I dress you up a little,

03:58.585 --> 04:01.305
and have you stand before Miss Lin,
she is sure to take a liking to you.

04:02.665 --> 04:04.625
I already used this little trick

04:04.705 --> 04:05.625
when I first met Cangcang.

04:06.225 --> 04:07.505
Then just cling to her and never give up,

04:07.585 --> 04:08.505
for even the finest lady
cannot resist a persistent suitor.

04:09.185 --> 04:11.105
Am I not pestering her every day already?

04:12.105 --> 04:12.945
Then,

04:13.865 --> 04:14.705
what do you say I should do?

04:19.384 --> 04:20.665
I have heard

04:20.745 --> 04:22.905
that there is a frozen
lake outside the camp,

04:23.545 --> 04:25.505
and perhaps Cangcang will like that place.

04:27.985 --> 04:30.505
The ice is slick,

04:30.585 --> 04:32.105
and you and Cangcang will no doubt

04:32.185 --> 04:33.945
have to lean on each other for support.
I understand.

04:34.865 --> 04:36.705
If you happen upon a thin patch of ice,

04:36.785 --> 04:37.945
and Cangcang happens to slip,

04:38.545 --> 04:40.425
Mr. Bai, you can leap in to
save her, sharing danger and fate,

04:40.505 --> 04:42.545
and once she is moved,
her heart will surely soften.

04:45.185 --> 04:46.745
That is indeed a fine idea.

04:48.145 --> 04:50.385
But will it not put Cangcang in danger?

04:50.985 --> 04:52.465
Of course it will not. Come.

04:53.745 --> 04:55.425
-Once we leave the camp,
-Go.

04:55.505 --> 04:56.985
I can find a way to send Cangcang away.

04:58.345 --> 04:59.265
It is snowing.

05:00.945 --> 05:02.585
-Wonderful, it is snowing!
-It is snowing!

05:02.665 --> 05:04.025
It is snowing.

05:04.105 --> 05:05.105
It is snowing.

05:05.185 --> 05:06.385
It is snowing!

05:06.465 --> 05:07.465
Good!

05:08.785 --> 05:10.385
It is snowing!

05:10.465 --> 05:12.145
The snow has finally begun to fall.

05:12.905 --> 05:14.865
Good!

05:14.945 --> 05:16.065
It is snowing!

05:17.465 --> 05:18.945
It is snowing!

05:19.025 --> 05:19.865
Good.

05:20.465 --> 05:21.665
It is truly heavy.

05:22.985 --> 05:24.065
Such heavy snow!

05:24.865 --> 05:25.705
Indeed.

05:28.785 --> 05:30.625
It is snowing!

05:31.225 --> 05:33.585
-It is snowing.
-Wonderful.

05:35.465 --> 05:36.585
It is snowing!

05:38.185 --> 05:39.905
This snow is truly heavy!

05:42.665 --> 05:43.585
Good!

05:48.465 --> 05:49.825
Xijiang is bitterly cold,

05:50.425 --> 05:51.945
and snowfall in winter is nothing unusual.

05:52.585 --> 05:54.505
Why are the soldiers so excited?

05:55.545 --> 05:56.465
Wonderful.

05:57.425 --> 05:58.545
Wonderful!

05:59.305 --> 06:00.145
Look.

06:01.625 --> 06:02.665
Good!

06:03.465 --> 06:04.905
-Good!
-Wonderful!

06:07.705 --> 06:09.465
Kumor,
the snowflakes are thick as feathers.

06:09.545 --> 06:10.585
We have finally been waiting for this.

06:13.905 --> 06:16.025
Could it be that Kumor has been
waiting for heavy snowfall all along,

06:16.665 --> 06:18.625
that he was not remaining still,

06:18.705 --> 06:20.745
but waiting for the rivers to freeze?

06:20.825 --> 06:22.505
Once the waters turn to ice,

06:23.105 --> 06:24.665
he will march across
the river and attack the city.

06:34.705 --> 06:35.705
General.

06:35.785 --> 06:36.945
Deputy General Zhang,

06:37.025 --> 06:39.265
keep a close watch
on Mr. Bai and Miss Lin.

06:39.345 --> 06:40.865
From this moment on,

06:40.945 --> 06:42.905
they are forbidden from
moving freely in the camp.

06:42.985 --> 06:44.265
Yes.

06:46.185 --> 06:48.105
Kumor, you again?

06:48.185 --> 06:49.305
They are my guests,

06:49.385 --> 06:50.425
not your prisoners.

06:51.025 --> 06:52.105
Minjia.

06:52.185 --> 06:53.585
The battle is upon us,

06:53.665 --> 06:55.425
and for safety's sake I must do this.

06:56.465 --> 06:57.345
As a princess,

06:57.425 --> 06:58.945
you should understand the reason.

07:19.865 --> 07:20.945
Your Highness.

07:21.025 --> 07:22.425
Didn't you say
you were going to the frozen lake

07:22.505 --> 07:24.025
to play the hero and save my lady?

07:24.105 --> 07:25.145
Why now…?

07:27.105 --> 07:29.145
It is snowing heavily today,
so we cannot go.

07:32.225 --> 07:34.345
Even Your Highness cannot help me now,

07:34.425 --> 07:36.945
so it must be fate,
and nothing can be done.

07:37.625 --> 07:38.985
Who says I cannot help you?

07:39.065 --> 07:40.185
There are plenty of ways.

07:41.465 --> 07:42.825
Just not today.

07:47.665 --> 07:49.185
Deputy General Zhang,

07:49.265 --> 07:50.705
when the time comes, lead two squads,

07:50.785 --> 07:51.905
and ambush at this location.

07:52.865 --> 07:54.585
As for the exact timing of the assault,

07:54.665 --> 07:56.025
wait for my command.

07:56.105 --> 07:56.945
Kumor.

07:57.585 --> 07:58.425
Minjia,

07:58.945 --> 08:00.105
you came just in time.

08:00.185 --> 08:01.865
We are discussing
the details of the attack.

08:01.945 --> 08:02.945
Come listen.

08:03.025 --> 08:04.105
After winter arrives,

08:04.185 --> 08:05.985
the moat around Jiangzhou freezes,

08:06.065 --> 08:07.305
and we will launch
a surprise attack on the East Gate.

08:07.385 --> 08:08.545
Was that not already decided?

08:09.265 --> 08:10.825
Kumor, you may settle the details.

08:11.425 --> 08:12.425
I have other matters to attend to.

08:12.505 --> 08:13.345
What is it you need?

08:13.945 --> 08:16.505
I am here to fetch a jar of good wine
for Miss Lin and Mr. Bai.

08:17.185 --> 08:18.625
If you wish to drink,

08:18.705 --> 08:20.185
there is wine in every other tent.

08:20.265 --> 08:21.705
Why must you come
to my command tent for it?

08:22.305 --> 08:24.105
I lost at chess, that is all.

08:24.185 --> 08:25.425
Chess?

08:26.105 --> 08:27.345
What kind of chess were you playing?

08:27.945 --> 08:29.385
Were we not talking about fetching wine?

08:29.465 --> 08:30.505
Why ask about chess?

08:31.185 --> 08:32.264
It was Tiger-Taming Chess.

08:33.345 --> 08:35.784
Kumor,
he won against me in his very first game.

08:36.705 --> 08:39.705
Tiger-Taming Chess tests one's
strategy and command of warfare.

08:39.784 --> 08:41.585
How could
a wandering swordsman defeat you?

08:41.664 --> 08:43.825
And I even used the moves you taught me.

08:44.585 --> 08:46.665
Perhaps if you played,
you might not beat him either.

08:48.745 --> 08:49.985
Minjia,

08:50.065 --> 08:51.305
if you are all going to drink,

08:51.385 --> 08:52.745
how could you do so without me?

08:53.345 --> 08:54.825
Then Kumor, I will fetch it now.

08:55.785 --> 08:56.625
Wait.

08:58.665 --> 08:59.705
-Deputy General Zhang.
-Yes.

09:00.305 --> 09:02.065
Bring me my Parting Wine.

09:02.145 --> 09:03.305
Yes, General.

09:09.505 --> 09:11.305
-Go make the preparations.
-Very well.

09:18.185 --> 09:19.665
Drinking in wind and snow.

09:20.265 --> 09:23.585
Mr. Bai,
I hope you will not mind my sudden visit.

09:24.665 --> 09:26.385
This wine today was meant

09:26.465 --> 09:27.865
as a kind gesture from Her Highness,

09:28.465 --> 09:31.025
but I did not expect
it would alarm the General.

09:31.625 --> 09:33.785
I am merely here to join in the merriment.

09:33.865 --> 09:35.385
Before we drink today,

09:35.465 --> 09:36.785
allow me first

09:36.865 --> 09:39.065
to tell you a legend of Xijiang.

09:39.145 --> 09:40.385
Legend holds that in our Xijiang,

09:40.465 --> 09:41.745
there once lived
a beautiful young maiden who,

09:41.825 --> 09:43.625
against all fate,
gave her heart to a prince

09:43.705 --> 09:45.225
with whom her family shared a mortal feud.

09:46.345 --> 09:49.105
In that very moment,
war broke out between their families.

09:49.185 --> 09:52.505
The prince himself slew the maiden's kin.

09:52.585 --> 09:54.025
Heartbroken beyond measure,

09:54.105 --> 09:56.425
the maiden took
the prince's life in return.

09:57.105 --> 09:57.945
Later,

09:58.585 --> 10:01.145
she found that after death,
the prince became a spring of clear water.

10:02.585 --> 10:05.385
She used that spring to brew a wine.

10:05.465 --> 10:06.665
And once one drinks it,

10:07.185 --> 10:09.985
all memories of past love fade away.

10:11.385 --> 10:12.625
Miss Lin,

10:12.705 --> 10:15.345
what do you think of this
legend of the Parting Wine?

10:19.065 --> 10:20.585
It is quite moving.

10:20.665 --> 10:22.745
I did not expect
the General to be a storyteller.

10:33.145 --> 10:34.105
Miss Lin,

10:34.705 --> 10:36.385
this is the Parting Wine of legend.

10:36.985 --> 10:39.625
If you no longer wish
to have any ties to Mr. Bai,

10:39.705 --> 10:41.625
you may feed this wine to him yourself.

10:49.985 --> 10:52.265
Cangcang, are you hesitating?

10:52.345 --> 10:54.105
Are you afraid
that if you drink this wine,

10:54.185 --> 10:55.785
you will truly forget him,

10:55.865 --> 10:57.505
because you still cannot forget him?

11:04.065 --> 11:07.265
If a single cup of this wine
could sever all love,

11:07.345 --> 11:09.105
there would be no
sorrowful lovers in this world.

11:09.865 --> 11:10.785
Miss Lin,

11:10.865 --> 11:12.225
from what you say,

11:12.305 --> 11:13.785
does it mean you do not wish to forget?

11:19.065 --> 11:20.225
Since the General is so kind,

11:21.345 --> 11:22.185
Bai Chifan,

11:23.185 --> 11:24.785
then drink this cup,

11:24.865 --> 11:26.225
and let us part in peace,

11:26.305 --> 11:27.345
leaving the past behind.

11:29.305 --> 11:30.585
Everything you say is true?

11:31.705 --> 11:33.545
You truly wish for
me to forget everything?

11:34.225 --> 11:36.425
-Yes.
-But I do not wish to forget.

11:40.305 --> 11:43.985
Since Mr. Bai refuses to drink,
Miss Lin may drink instead.

11:44.585 --> 11:46.345
After all, this Parting Wine

11:46.425 --> 11:49.705
needs only one of you to drink it
for love to be severed.

11:55.585 --> 11:56.905
Life and death parted…

11:56.985 --> 11:58.545
Could this be poisoned wine?

11:58.625 --> 12:00.985
-Very well. Then I shall drink it.
-Wait.

12:02.665 --> 12:04.065
If anyone should
drink it, it ought to be me.

12:05.745 --> 12:07.985
Did you not already cut all ties with me?

12:08.065 --> 12:09.425
Why bother with this Parting Wine then?

12:11.585 --> 12:12.465
Let me drink it instead.

12:13.065 --> 12:15.225
Once I drink it,
I will never cling to you again.

12:16.785 --> 12:18.865
You want to wipe away all
that you owe me with one cup?

12:19.465 --> 12:20.585
Would that not be far too easy for you?

12:22.265 --> 12:23.105
What is it?

12:24.145 --> 12:25.185
Could it be you still
have feelings for me?

12:48.585 --> 12:50.985
I simply believe
that making you remember everything

12:51.065 --> 12:52.185
is the greatest punishment for you.

13:00.265 --> 13:02.265
-Bai Chifan!
-Good wine.

13:05.345 --> 13:07.505
You were all fooled by my brother.

13:07.585 --> 13:09.425
This Parting Wine is only a legend.

13:10.025 --> 13:11.065
Cangcang, do not worry.

13:11.665 --> 13:13.145
Mr. Bai could never forget you.

13:13.225 --> 13:14.705
The moment I tested him,

13:14.785 --> 13:16.145
I knew you had not let him go.

13:16.745 --> 13:19.065
Today my brother and I are witnesses.

13:19.145 --> 13:20.665
Neither of you is allowed to deny it.

13:35.345 --> 13:36.345
Bai.

13:44.745 --> 13:45.905
Bai.

13:53.945 --> 13:54.785
Bai.

13:55.825 --> 13:57.505
Kumor, what is happening?

13:58.385 --> 13:59.705
True parting

14:00.305 --> 14:02.025
can only be found in life and death.

14:03.105 --> 14:06.465
This cup of Parting Wine
he drank of his own will.

14:31.065 --> 14:31.905
How is he?

14:36.465 --> 14:38.745
This young man's pulse is very strange.

14:39.665 --> 14:40.825
There is an overwhelming cold in him,

14:41.585 --> 14:43.265
and it seems restrained by medicine.

14:43.345 --> 14:45.065
Enough talk. Treat him quickly!

14:45.585 --> 14:47.705
I only travel with the army,
and I specialize in external wounds.

14:47.785 --> 14:49.025
A condition like this…

14:49.105 --> 14:50.585
I am not confident.

14:50.665 --> 14:52.265
Whether you are
confident or not, you must treat him.

14:52.345 --> 14:53.345
If you fail, you will answer to me!

14:53.425 --> 14:55.665
Yes. I will return

14:56.265 --> 14:58.705
and prepare warming
medicines to dispel the cold.

15:00.025 --> 15:01.705
Cangcang, watch over him first.

15:14.305 --> 15:15.305
So cold…

15:23.305 --> 15:24.745
So the Empress

15:24.825 --> 15:27.425
is not as heartless as you claim to be.

15:32.865 --> 15:34.745
You are at death's door,
yet you still say such things.

15:38.705 --> 15:40.625
I am at death's door,

15:40.705 --> 15:41.825
and you still shake me off.

15:43.505 --> 15:45.305
You knew that wine was poisoned.

15:45.385 --> 15:46.385
Why test it with your own life?

15:47.105 --> 15:49.345
If not me, should I have let you drink it?

15:57.145 --> 15:58.785
Letting the Empress drink poison?

15:58.865 --> 16:00.505
Would that not make
me unworthy as a husband?

16:02.265 --> 16:03.665
Besides,

16:03.745 --> 16:05.785
only because I drank the poison

16:05.865 --> 16:08.225
did I see your true feelings for me.

16:14.865 --> 16:15.705
Xiao Huan,

16:19.465 --> 16:21.385
it was you who gave
me hope again and again,

16:23.705 --> 16:25.465
only to use me again and again,

16:26.025 --> 16:27.025
and hurt me.

16:29.305 --> 16:32.225
I have finally decided to leave you,
yet here you are again.

16:33.465 --> 16:35.145
What do you want?

16:35.225 --> 16:37.425
What must I do for you to be satisfied?

16:39.505 --> 16:40.345
Have you forgotten?

16:41.105 --> 16:42.465
There is cold poison in me.

16:43.185 --> 16:46.065
Normal poison has no effect on me at all.

16:47.185 --> 16:48.625
I was only pretending for their sake.

16:50.145 --> 16:50.985
Is that true?

16:52.665 --> 16:53.905
Of course it is.

16:59.025 --> 16:59.865
Liar.

17:00.905 --> 17:01.985
Cangcang, wait.

17:06.184 --> 17:07.184
Come sit here first.

17:08.025 --> 17:09.184
There is something I need to tell you.

17:17.184 --> 17:19.345
-Give me the antidote.
-There is no antidote.

17:22.345 --> 17:24.625
Kumor, why would you do this?

17:27.585 --> 17:28.424
Minjia,

17:29.585 --> 17:31.185
did you not notice
anything wrong with him?

17:32.265 --> 17:33.385
He is just a wanderer.

17:33.945 --> 17:35.745
How could he beat
you in Tiger-Taming Chess?

17:36.785 --> 17:38.865
He clearly knows military strategy.

17:38.945 --> 17:40.185
And as soon as the snow fell,

17:40.265 --> 17:42.385
he immediately watched
how you and I reacted.

17:43.665 --> 17:46.105
His eyes are sharp, deep and unreadable.

17:46.185 --> 17:47.425
He is no ordinary wanderer!

17:47.505 --> 17:49.065
You are simply too suspicious!

17:49.145 --> 17:50.945
The battle is right before us!

17:51.545 --> 17:54.825
As commander,
I must eliminate every threat.

17:56.985 --> 17:59.065
There is definitely
something wrong with Bai Chifan.

18:00.665 --> 18:01.545
I absolutely cannot keep him alive.

18:10.865 --> 18:12.065
He saved my life.

18:12.905 --> 18:14.105
I will not let you kill him.

18:14.865 --> 18:16.665
He is barely hanging on anyway.

18:19.305 --> 18:20.505
He will not last long even without me.

18:20.585 --> 18:21.505
You…

18:30.985 --> 18:32.865
General Ling has obtained the map.

18:32.945 --> 18:34.505
He will make his move soon.

18:35.145 --> 18:36.825
You must see
General Ling as soon as possible.

18:37.545 --> 18:38.385
Tell him,

18:38.985 --> 18:41.665
Kumor is waiting for
the frozen season to arrive.

18:42.665 --> 18:44.225
If I go, what about you?

18:46.505 --> 18:49.625
I will create a chance for you to escape.

18:50.985 --> 18:52.145
I asked how you will escape.

18:58.265 --> 18:59.585
Why are you laughing?

19:02.225 --> 19:03.145
Nothing.

19:08.425 --> 19:09.465
Do not flatter yourself.

19:09.545 --> 19:11.105
You are the ruler of a nation.

19:11.185 --> 19:12.665
If you die inexplicably here,

19:13.345 --> 19:14.585
our entire family will be condemned.

19:17.705 --> 19:19.505
It is just that I often think of

19:19.585 --> 19:21.465
our days wandering the martial world.

19:23.025 --> 19:24.025
Tell me,

19:24.705 --> 19:27.025
if we truly were a pair of wanderers,

19:28.545 --> 19:29.705
would it have ended differently?

19:35.985 --> 19:37.105
There are no what ifs.

19:43.585 --> 19:44.785
Mr. Bai.

19:47.465 --> 19:49.825
Mr. Bai. How are you feeling?

19:50.705 --> 19:52.105
Thank you for arranging
everything, Your Highness.

19:53.065 --> 19:54.345
Cangcang no longer bears hatred for me.

19:55.425 --> 19:57.145
I have no regrets even in death.

19:57.825 --> 19:58.665
It is my fault.

19:59.705 --> 20:01.265
I am the one who harmed you.

20:03.105 --> 20:04.865
This has nothing to do
with you, Your Highness.

20:04.945 --> 20:06.505
Do not blame yourself.

20:07.225 --> 20:08.065
I am fine now.

20:09.945 --> 20:11.825
That cup held an extreme cold poison.

20:11.905 --> 20:14.185
Its venom is ruthless. Mr. Bai, you…

20:15.345 --> 20:16.625
Mr. Bai…

20:16.705 --> 20:17.705
Bai…

20:20.905 --> 20:22.065
Bai…

20:31.065 --> 20:32.025
It is my fault.

20:32.105 --> 20:33.305
All my fault.

20:33.385 --> 20:34.505
I will find the antidote.

20:35.185 --> 20:36.145
It is useless.

20:37.305 --> 20:39.465
This cold sickness
has plagued me for years.

20:40.305 --> 20:41.785
Now that it has been triggered,

20:41.865 --> 20:43.225
it may never heal again.

20:44.345 --> 20:46.265
Perhaps this is simply my fate.

20:47.505 --> 20:48.585
I will die here.

20:49.185 --> 20:50.185
What nonsense is that?

20:50.265 --> 20:51.385
I will not let you die.

20:54.505 --> 20:55.545
What did you just say?

20:59.785 --> 21:01.345
I said I will never let you die here.

21:02.585 --> 21:03.865
Mr. Bai, did you hear that?

21:04.465 --> 21:05.785
This is Cangcang's true heart.

21:06.465 --> 21:08.745
For her sake, you must not die.

21:11.465 --> 21:12.585
It is too late.

21:13.785 --> 21:15.265
What could Cangcang possibly do?

21:18.105 --> 21:19.185
In Jiangzhou City,

21:20.225 --> 21:21.585
there might be a divine
physician who can save me.

21:23.225 --> 21:24.985
But Cangcang cannot leave the camp.

21:25.945 --> 21:27.185
And even if she could,

21:28.585 --> 21:30.305
I would not last long
enough for her return.

21:31.065 --> 21:32.145
Jiangzhou City…

21:33.465 --> 21:35.905
To leave the camp,
I need my brother's token.

21:37.145 --> 21:38.505
But with the heavy snow,

21:40.265 --> 21:41.745
he will never allow
any of you to leave now.

21:47.705 --> 21:49.025
Your Highness do not trouble yourself.

21:51.345 --> 21:52.825
Perhaps this is indeed my fate.

22:00.065 --> 22:01.825
This happened because of me.

22:01.905 --> 22:02.945
I cannot just stand by.

22:04.265 --> 22:05.665
Nor can I ignore your life.

22:06.865 --> 22:09.025
Cangcang,
I will steal my brother's token right now

22:09.105 --> 22:10.145
so you can leave and find the physician.

22:11.185 --> 22:12.185
Thank you, Your Highness.

22:30.945 --> 22:32.345
I know what you are thinking.

22:34.465 --> 22:35.865
I do need you to save my life.

22:37.945 --> 22:39.745
Before I came to Jiangzhou,

22:40.585 --> 22:42.065
I sent Imperial Physician Li ahead.

22:45.625 --> 22:46.465
Imperial Physician Li…

22:47.265 --> 22:48.905
You only need to tell him my symptoms,

22:50.025 --> 22:51.145
and he will be able
to prescribe the remedy.

22:53.105 --> 22:53.945
Very well.

22:54.465 --> 22:56.185
Imperial Preceptor Du
must also have your tonic pills.

22:56.265 --> 22:57.145
I will bring those back too.

22:58.785 --> 23:01.865
I never expected
that she would not save you.

23:03.185 --> 23:04.505
She was not like this before.

23:04.585 --> 23:06.225
None of that matters.

23:07.145 --> 23:09.945
What matters now is saving your life.

23:26.385 --> 23:28.865
This is my handwritten decree.

23:30.705 --> 23:31.985
Give it to General Ling.

23:49.945 --> 23:50.785
Xiao Huan.

23:51.985 --> 23:53.625
I want you to wait for me,

23:53.705 --> 23:54.945
and to wait for me in safety.

23:58.025 --> 23:59.705
If anything happens to you,

24:00.785 --> 24:02.425
I will never forgive you.

24:02.505 --> 24:03.385
Do you understand?

24:12.905 --> 24:13.785
I understand.

24:15.585 --> 24:16.585
I will go.

24:18.145 --> 24:19.105
Cangcang,

24:23.625 --> 24:24.545
be careful.

25:00.905 --> 25:02.745
Cangcang. You're wearing my armor,

25:02.825 --> 25:03.785
riding my warhorse.

25:03.865 --> 25:05.305
And once you put on this veil

25:05.385 --> 25:07.185
that I always wear in winter,

25:07.265 --> 25:08.385
they won't recognize you.

25:09.825 --> 25:10.985
This is my brother's token.

25:16.905 --> 25:17.945
Thank you.

25:18.025 --> 25:19.585
You're not planning
to never return, right?

25:21.585 --> 25:22.545
Don't worry.

25:23.265 --> 25:24.545
Since Bai Chifan is here,

25:25.465 --> 25:26.465
as long as I live, I'll return.

25:42.865 --> 25:43.905
I am Princess Minjia.

25:43.985 --> 25:45.785
By order of the Prince, I am going to
the pass to deliver a letter of challenge.

25:45.865 --> 25:46.985
Make way!

25:52.705 --> 25:53.545
Who dares leave the camp?

25:55.625 --> 25:56.625
-Prepare the horses!
-Yes!

26:46.985 --> 26:48.945
Quick! Lower the bridge, open the gate!

26:55.145 --> 26:56.225
Loose!

27:25.025 --> 27:26.185
Retreat!

27:33.145 --> 27:34.065
Cangcang.

27:34.145 --> 27:35.465
Why did you come back?

27:35.545 --> 27:37.545
No time to explain.
Hurry. Take me to Imperial Physician Li.

27:37.625 --> 27:39.905
Imperial Physician Li?
He is not in Jiangzhou City.

27:40.785 --> 27:41.825
Not in Jiangzhou City?

27:42.425 --> 27:43.625
Cangcang, what is going on?

27:46.265 --> 27:47.865
Preceptor Du… Where is the Preceptor Du?

27:47.945 --> 27:49.545
-I must see her.
-Come.

27:51.105 --> 27:52.145
Preceptor Du.

27:52.225 --> 27:53.745
Your Majesty's safe return

27:54.305 --> 27:55.705
is truly Heaven's blessing for Great Qi.

27:55.785 --> 27:56.705
No need for courtesy.

27:56.785 --> 27:58.385
Where is Imperial Physician Li?
Where is his medicine?

28:01.585 --> 28:02.425
Yes.

28:04.185 --> 28:05.065
What did Your Majesty say?

28:05.145 --> 28:07.305
He's trapped in Kumor's camp.

28:07.385 --> 28:08.825
His old illness flared up,
and his life is in danger.

28:08.905 --> 28:09.825
I came back for medicine.

28:11.825 --> 28:12.865
What did Your Majesty say?

28:13.385 --> 28:14.785
You don't know?

28:18.945 --> 28:21.265
Imperial Physician Li
truly isn't in the city.

28:25.825 --> 28:26.745
Could it be…

28:30.265 --> 28:31.945
The letter he gave you. See what it says.

28:34.545 --> 28:35.305
KUMOR'S TROOPS AWAIT
THE FREEZING OF THE MOAT

28:35.385 --> 28:36.265
AND MAY AT ANY MOMENT FORCE THEIR WAY
ACROSS TO STRIKE AT THE EAST GATE.

28:36.345 --> 28:37.025
DO NOT ACT RASHLY.
MOVE ONLY UPON COMMAND.

28:37.945 --> 28:39.905
His Majesty instructs,
according to his judgment,

28:40.505 --> 28:42.505
the Kumor troops are
waiting for the moat to freeze,

28:42.585 --> 28:44.345
so they may cross at any
time and attack the East Gate.

28:44.985 --> 28:45.905
But His Majesty decrees

28:45.985 --> 28:48.145
that we must not take action on our own.
We are to wait for orders.

28:49.545 --> 28:50.705
Wait for orders?

28:52.865 --> 28:54.385
-Nothing else was said?
-Nothing.

28:57.345 --> 28:59.625
This is bad. I'm going to save him.

29:01.265 --> 29:04.385
His Majesty commands
that the Empress must remain in the city.

29:04.945 --> 29:06.025
I cannot disobey the decree.

29:11.105 --> 29:12.145
Kumor!

29:13.145 --> 29:14.185
Kumor.

29:14.265 --> 29:15.425
Mr. Bai can't hold on anymore.

29:15.505 --> 29:16.385
I was the one who let Cangcang go.

29:16.465 --> 29:18.145
If anyone must be punished, punish me.
Kumor.

29:18.865 --> 29:19.705
Kumor!

29:35.505 --> 29:38.065
General Kumor.
Please step outside the tent.

29:38.665 --> 29:40.025
I can tell you myself

29:40.745 --> 29:41.785
who I truly am.

29:45.625 --> 29:47.865
The poison that struck
you that day has no cure at all.

29:47.945 --> 29:49.065
It was His Majesty

29:50.705 --> 29:52.425
who gave you the Frost Reed.

29:53.185 --> 29:55.625
He gave you the only Frost Reed
that could save his life!

29:57.625 --> 29:59.385
There is no lifesaving medicine left.

30:00.705 --> 30:01.785
For Your Majesty,

30:01.865 --> 30:03.265
His Majesty risked everything alone,

30:03.345 --> 30:04.185
sneaking into the Kumor's camp.

30:04.865 --> 30:06.825
All his life,
His Majesty has been cautious,

30:06.905 --> 30:07.865
disciplined and restrained,

30:08.585 --> 30:09.665
but for you,

30:09.745 --> 30:12.185
he has sacrificed himself again and again.

30:13.705 --> 30:14.905
Have you never thought

30:14.985 --> 30:16.865
that the tenderness he showed you

30:17.705 --> 30:19.785
could not have all been false?

30:31.465 --> 30:33.945
Do you know His Majesty
has long been nearing his end?

30:36.065 --> 30:38.025
And the one who brought him to this state

30:39.705 --> 30:40.985
is you.

30:43.185 --> 30:44.825
May I ask Your Majesty,

30:45.825 --> 30:48.025
can you bear the weight
of His Majesty's devotion?

31:02.905 --> 31:04.145
Jueding.

31:05.265 --> 31:06.705
Is the Xiaoxing Guards
now inside the city?

31:06.785 --> 31:07.625
Yes.

31:07.705 --> 31:09.505
Assign your elite
troops and archers to me.

31:09.585 --> 31:12.105
His Majesty commands it,
you are not to leave Jiangzhou City.

31:14.265 --> 31:15.465
Then this will not
count as defying the decree.

31:38.625 --> 31:41.585
General. Do you dare face me in battle?

31:44.065 --> 31:45.265
So you finally drop the act.

31:46.225 --> 31:47.865
Is it because Miss Lin is now safe?

31:48.785 --> 31:51.265
I heard you personally gave chase,

31:52.065 --> 31:55.105
and watched with your own eyes
as Cangcang entered Jiangzhou City.

31:55.185 --> 31:56.225
Good.

31:58.145 --> 31:59.345
You truly are devoted.

32:00.585 --> 32:01.665
Very well.

32:01.745 --> 32:04.865
Today, let me see what your blade can do!

32:38.545 --> 32:39.665
Kumor!

32:43.905 --> 32:46.665
Your blade technique is
not much weaker than mine.

32:47.385 --> 32:48.825
You are simply
disadvantaged by your weapon.

32:49.425 --> 32:51.465
I, as a general,
hate being threatened the most.

32:52.345 --> 32:54.945
Do you think
this will let you leave here alive?

32:56.145 --> 32:57.705
Since you dislike coercion,

32:58.305 --> 33:00.105
why did you use Cangcang to coerce me?

33:02.145 --> 33:05.345
-What do you mean by that?
-Have you not been asking who I really am?

33:06.025 --> 33:07.265
I can tell you now.

33:09.705 --> 33:10.545
Speak!

33:11.825 --> 33:14.145
Rumor spreads throughout your camp

33:14.225 --> 33:15.425
that Xiao Huan, Emperor of Great Qi,

33:16.105 --> 33:17.665
cannot even lift his shoulders,

33:17.745 --> 33:19.105
cannot even carry anything by hand,

33:19.185 --> 33:21.865
and does not dare step outside the palace.

33:22.585 --> 33:23.905
Is that what you believe as well?

33:39.305 --> 33:41.385
You are Xiao Huan, Emperor of Great Qi?

33:42.905 --> 33:43.785
I am.

33:44.905 --> 33:46.105
Then what about Lin Cangcang?

33:46.705 --> 33:48.265
Is she truly the Empress of Great Qi?

33:49.065 --> 33:51.785
Her surname is Ling,
the Ling of lofty aspirations.

33:52.385 --> 33:54.945
Ling Cangcang is my empress.

33:57.025 --> 33:58.025
I never imagined

33:58.105 --> 34:00.225
that the ruler above all others

34:00.305 --> 34:01.985
would risk death in an enemy camp,

34:02.065 --> 34:03.945
all for a single woman.

34:04.785 --> 34:06.345
How is it risking death?

34:06.425 --> 34:08.985
Do you truly think that you alone
can kill your way out?

34:09.824 --> 34:11.545
You underestimate my
Black Tiger Army far too much.

34:13.145 --> 34:16.304
I never intended
to rely on my own strength to escape.

34:18.665 --> 34:20.105
My plan was to send out

34:20.665 --> 34:22.145
the Military Deployment Map first,

34:22.824 --> 34:24.264
then send the Empress away,

34:24.344 --> 34:25.505
and finally,

34:25.585 --> 34:28.465
let the Western Garrison
launch a surprise attack on your camp.

34:30.264 --> 34:31.865
But the map is still with me.

34:31.945 --> 34:34.665
The map was redrawn by
the Empress and me after we read it.

34:35.744 --> 34:37.185
Of course your copy remains with you.

34:42.824 --> 34:45.304
So your hunting match with Minjia

34:45.385 --> 34:46.784
was to send out the map.

34:47.665 --> 34:48.545
Naturally.

34:49.264 --> 34:51.865
You people of
the Central Plains truly are cunning.

34:51.945 --> 34:52.784
But it is a pity.

34:53.465 --> 34:55.025
You are about to die here.

34:56.945 --> 34:58.065
Is that so?

35:17.505 --> 35:18.465
Go.

35:23.665 --> 35:25.185
You truly are not afraid of death.

35:25.785 --> 35:27.425
The one not afraid of death is you.

35:55.065 --> 35:57.385
This is my personal Xiaoxing Guards.

35:57.465 --> 35:58.905
Each one possesses exceptional skill.

35:58.985 --> 36:01.145
Taking the General's head

36:01.225 --> 36:02.665
would be no challenge at all.

36:07.345 --> 36:08.265
Tonight we infiltrate the enemy camp.

36:08.985 --> 36:10.625
Tomorrow we will seize
the chance to rescue His Majesty.

36:10.705 --> 36:11.625
Yes.

36:16.825 --> 36:19.145
My Black Tiger Army stands
here with one hundred thousand troops.

36:19.825 --> 36:21.545
With just these few of you,

36:21.625 --> 36:24.145
you think you can take my head?

36:24.225 --> 36:25.665
You are far too arrogant.

36:26.345 --> 36:27.865
And what of your hundred thousand troops?

36:28.625 --> 36:30.225
Great Qi commands a million soldiers.

36:30.305 --> 36:31.505
At a single order,

36:32.105 --> 36:33.305
this place will fall.

36:33.385 --> 36:35.385
What will you do then, General?

36:35.985 --> 36:38.545
Do you not care at all
for the lives of your soldiers?

36:46.465 --> 36:48.465
Of course
the General cares for their lives.

37:13.865 --> 37:16.425
Otherwise why would he wait for
snow and ice to launch a surprise attack,

37:16.505 --> 37:17.545
instead of acting recklessly?

37:18.465 --> 37:20.745
Ling Cangcang, you dare to return?

37:21.545 --> 37:23.225
I am the Empress of Great Qi.

37:23.945 --> 37:26.345
Where His Majesty stands, so shall I.

37:31.545 --> 37:33.105
The Emperor is cunning,

37:33.185 --> 37:34.545
and the Empress is sly.

37:35.305 --> 37:36.865
You truly make a fine pair.

37:36.945 --> 37:38.105
Kumor.

37:38.905 --> 37:40.305
If we are speaking of cunning,

37:40.385 --> 37:42.985
that cup of Parting Wine
you poisoned is no less so.

37:43.665 --> 37:44.625
We are the same.

37:45.905 --> 37:47.745
General, why not hear me out first

37:47.825 --> 37:49.105
before making your decision?

37:50.185 --> 37:51.345
Speak.

37:51.425 --> 37:52.985
Once both sides go to war,

37:53.065 --> 37:54.185
Xijiang will be trampled flat.

37:55.625 --> 37:57.905
I have had the fortune of
spending a few days with you,

37:57.985 --> 38:00.705
and found you a disciplined commander

38:00.785 --> 38:02.345
who holds the people in your heart.

38:03.145 --> 38:03.985
Thus,

38:04.825 --> 38:06.225
I can give you a chance,

38:07.105 --> 38:08.705
and give Xijiang a chance.

38:09.305 --> 38:10.145
General,

38:10.905 --> 38:12.665
would you negotiate peace with me?

38:22.345 --> 38:25.265
Speak then.
You have stayed here for some time.

38:26.185 --> 38:27.385
What do you see?

38:28.345 --> 38:29.185
I know,

38:29.905 --> 38:31.705
the General claims one
hundred thousand troops,

38:32.345 --> 38:34.865
but in truth your camp
has fewer than sixty thousand.

38:35.785 --> 38:37.025
Sixty thousand, and so what?

38:37.825 --> 38:40.825
Our sixty thousand
troops are all fierce and brave.

38:40.905 --> 38:42.945
It is not certain
we cannot take your Jiangzhou City.

38:45.505 --> 38:47.825
Jiangzhou City is impregnable.

38:47.905 --> 38:49.785
Its moat is both wide and deep.

38:50.545 --> 38:51.745
I know,

38:51.825 --> 38:53.465
you have held your troops still

38:53.545 --> 38:54.905
waiting for the moat to freeze.

38:56.305 --> 38:59.105
But now,
I have already ordered General Ling

38:59.185 --> 39:02.465
to scatter salt into the moat,
slowing the freezing.

39:05.225 --> 39:06.345
Since that is so,

39:07.265 --> 39:09.265
I see no need for peace talks.

39:10.025 --> 39:11.585
We will meet on the battlefield.

39:12.185 --> 39:13.265
You misunderstand, General.

39:14.425 --> 39:15.945
What I mean is this.

39:16.865 --> 39:18.985
You have always loved
your soldiers as your own children,

39:19.065 --> 39:20.745
and you cannot let them die in vain.

39:30.465 --> 39:32.185
Once the bow is
drawn, there is no turning back.

39:33.345 --> 39:34.905
If there is war,

39:34.985 --> 39:36.985
blood will be shed and lives lost.

39:38.305 --> 39:41.145
But when the time comes,
we sons and daughters of Xijiang

39:41.225 --> 39:42.625
will never fear death in battle.

39:51.585 --> 39:52.425
I know.

39:53.145 --> 39:55.705
Winter came early in Xijiang this year,

39:55.785 --> 39:57.825
bringing a once-in-a-century
snow calamity.

39:57.905 --> 40:00.865
The people suffered from cold and hunger,
wandering without shelter.

40:01.585 --> 40:03.185
The granaries of
the prefecture office ran empty,

40:03.265 --> 40:04.105
and the relief was ineffective.

40:05.505 --> 40:07.745
Even after the disaster passed,
the hardships still remained.

40:08.705 --> 40:11.145
The status verification
system only made it worse.

40:11.785 --> 40:13.105
Thus in this peace negotiation,

40:13.825 --> 40:14.865
I offer three promises.

40:16.585 --> 40:17.425
First.

40:18.065 --> 40:21.465
Great Qi will open our granaries and
provide relief to the people of Xijiang,

40:21.545 --> 40:23.265
easing the suffering
caused by the snow disaster.

40:24.185 --> 40:26.425
Second.
We will seek experts in agriculture,

40:27.025 --> 40:29.105
teach the people to farm,
improve the soil,

40:29.705 --> 40:31.305
and answer the needs of Xijiang.

40:32.185 --> 40:33.465
Third.

40:33.545 --> 40:34.425
I vow

40:35.185 --> 40:36.265
that within three years,

40:36.345 --> 40:37.225
the status verification
system will be abolished,

40:38.345 --> 40:40.745
freeing the people from bondage,

40:40.825 --> 40:42.185
and restoring peace to Xijiang.

40:55.145 --> 40:55.985
Kumor,

40:56.625 --> 40:59.145
when Xijiang's fields grow rich,
its harvests are abundant,

40:59.225 --> 41:01.865
and its people live in peace,
storing grain for winter,

41:02.625 --> 41:03.705
is that not what you wish to see?

41:10.865 --> 41:12.345
But I once led troops to attack your city,

41:13.625 --> 41:14.945
and even harmed you many times.

41:15.865 --> 41:17.825
-You are, after all, an emperor…
-As long as you are willing to turn back,

41:18.345 --> 41:19.625
all that is past,

41:20.145 --> 41:21.185
I shall not pursue.

41:40.265 --> 41:42.185
I, Kumor, do not fear life or death.

41:42.905 --> 41:44.545
I only wish to speak
for the people of Xijiang.

41:45.465 --> 41:46.945
If Your Majesty can truly keep your word,

41:47.545 --> 41:49.345
I am willing to give you my life,

41:49.425 --> 41:50.265
and follow you for all generations!

41:59.385 --> 42:00.345
General, please rise.

42:11.265 --> 42:12.265
I stand by every word I say.

42:12.905 --> 42:14.385
Set your mind at ease.

42:38.185 --> 42:39.265
This Black Feather Token

42:39.825 --> 42:40.865
belonged to my father the commander.

42:42.985 --> 42:44.265
Today, I offer it to Your Majesty.

42:45.185 --> 42:47.225
I, Kumor, swear before heaven and earth

42:47.905 --> 42:50.665
that once this token is sent forth,
I shall follow unto death.

42:51.225 --> 42:53.225
TOKEN

42:57.545 --> 42:58.425
General,

42:58.505 --> 43:00.705
you are a hero of this age.
I shall protect it.

43:02.025 --> 43:05.065
As for the soldiers and people of Xijiang,
I shall cherish them.

43:13.985 --> 43:15.665
Kumor, King of Xijiang,

43:16.265 --> 43:17.425
leads the Black Tiger Army

43:17.505 --> 43:19.545
to pledge allegiance to Great Qi!

43:28.785 --> 43:31.585
Long live the Emperor!

43:32.185 --> 43:35.625
Long live the Emperor!
